    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Fhb6PpcAQbHfUeJ0",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>what is attaboy?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_4XJvS3awiFqryjnG",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>attaboy is your daily upgrade. one scoop that combines performance, recovery, focus, hydration, and hormone support. built for men who want to simplify their supplement routine without compromising results.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_J237KNR7XLYDWGlP",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>what&apos;s actually in it?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_yeihGm2bvQUXLBi7",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>creatine monohydrate, l-citrulline, alpha-gpc, glycine, l-theanine, acetyl-l-carnitine, magnesium glycinate, sodium citrate, potassium citrate &amp; chloride, and more. </p><p></p><p>all dosed with intention. no filler. no fluff.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_6lLxq3rlxITGwNEQ",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>what does it replace?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_an1N9EOazm7a85vo",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>your creatine, magnesium, electrolyte mix, nootropics, sleep aid, and pre-workout add-ons. we condensed the cabinet into one clinically-backed, high-performance scoop.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_c64Lfh1rF7yPqbuu",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>how do i take it?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_FBDVoHJ5pE5DoGXN",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>once a day. mix with 10-16 oz of cold water, or blend into your morning drink of choice. morning is best, but consistency is king.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_PLGUxlXU1RQCGFkZ",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>can i stack this with other supplements?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Vp68UBsJcvkYerwx",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>yes. attaboy is designed to be foundational. you can still run your protein, greens, or fish oil - if you actually want to.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_hjqjl6bxptIZEiBe",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>does it have caffeine?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_PPbABSSh229seVDb",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>nope. no stimulants. just real ingredients that support natural energy, clarity, and mood - without the crash.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_cVBBZH2GxMGdY8GE",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>is it safe for daily use?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_ZfswTNPQXMvJ9rOf",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>yes. every ingredient is \"gras\" (generally recognized as safe) and dosed with real data in mind. nothing shady, nothing underdosed.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Rc0tzoIZxe1xz9GG",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>will this help with testosterone?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_MK50hrFm0O4zsmmR",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>attaboy helps regulate cortisol and support testosterone levels - especially when combined with good sleep, training, and diet. it&apos;s not a t-booster, it&apos;s a system optimizer.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_cugrGuzBfgTKNy1T",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>what&apos;s the flavor like?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_neL26uF47sblLdTO",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>coastal lime. it&apos;s crisp, salty, refreshing - and way better than anything in a gas station shaker bottle.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_r7MSyoAOxYwMlmu7",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>where is it made?</h3>"
    },
